WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.280
We've got Lupita Nyong'o here.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.360
Hello.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.230
It's so good to see you.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.300
It's been a long time
since we've seen Nakia.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.100
Yes.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.322
Can you tell us a little
bit what she's been up to?

00:00:11.322 --> 00:00:13.040
You're about to find out.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.060
That's fair.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.190
Well, maybe just catch us up
on what it's like that there.

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.500
Like, OK, she went to
the beach or something.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.640
She did go to the beach.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.970
The beach is great.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:21.770
Yeah.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:24.860
I mean, it's been a while
since we last saw her.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.560
She's grown and matured.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.990
She's also lost her main love.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.310
So we see how she's
handling that.

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.110
Yes.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:34.610
Now, Nakia is a War Dog.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.280
And I know for a lot of
people, they often assume

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.540
that she's a Dora Milaje.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.860
Tell us a little bit about--
- A little about--

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:40.660
A Dora Milaje.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.830
Tell us a little bit of the
difference between War Dogs

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.200
and Dora Milaje for people
who are not in the know.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.600
Well, War Dogs are
undercover spies.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.310
So they're training.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:52.160
Yes, they're trained in
combat and stuff like that.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.550
But their training
is very different.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:56.570
They go under the radar,
whereas the Dora Milaje are

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.160
very much the army of Wakanda.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.470
So they definitely
have to work in tandem.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:06.110
But she's a little
bit more exposed

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:07.190
to the rest of the world.

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:10.970
And she's like, she's the one
who brings intel to Wakanda

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.350
that keeps them on top.

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:13.250
Ooh.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.480
I want to dive in deeper about--

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.310
I'm so fascinated
about your experience

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:17.900
as being this War Dog, Nakia.

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:20.450
You know, she spends a lot of
her time away from Wakanda.

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:21.360
But she loves it.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:24.680
What keeps her going
in her mission?

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:25.480
Wow.

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:29.480
Sorry to break it to you.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.440
I mean, wow.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:36.590
This is like a class
that I need to pass.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:38.150
What keeps her going?

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.620
I think love of country
and a love of her people.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:46.170
And she is a very
principled person.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.630
There are certain
things she stands for.

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:50.690
And she really believes in the
power of humanity together.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:53.790
And I think she brings
that to her work.

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.070
I mean, A plus right there.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:57.620
I mean, you just done passed
the class right there.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:59.210
Lupita Nyong'o, I know
there's so many people

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.240
want to get to talk to you.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:03.530
We're so excited to see
you back here in the MCU

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:05.210
and taking us through
Wakanda Forever.

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.297
So thank you so much.

00:02:06.297 --> 00:02:08.330
Have you got anything that you
want to say to the Marvel fans

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:09.410
before we head out?

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:13.400
I'm just so happy to be back.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:14.430
We love you so much.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:15.530
Enjoy the night, Lupita.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.710
So good to see you.

